---
// src/pages/faq.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="FAQ">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8">Často kladené otázky</h1>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <details class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
      <summary
        class="cursor-pointer py-3 px-4 font-semibold hover:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg text-xl"
        >Užitečné informace</summary
      >
      <div class="p-4 text-sm leading-6 overflow-y-scroll max-h-96">
        <p>
          Pokud chceš ve hře zobrazit tohle okno, napiš <code>!motd</code>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Pokud máš připomínky, nápady na zlepšení, nebo chceš nahlásit
          podvádějícího hráče, napiš nám v sekci KONTAKT.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Majitelem serveru je crazy69.</strong></p>
        <p>Hosting zabezpečuje FakaHeda.eu.</p>
        <p>Najdeš nás taky na Facebooku - hledej: LaMaTeAm.eu.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
      <summary
        class="cursor-pointer py-3 px-4 font-semibold hover:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg text-xl"
        >Jak nahrát demo?</summary
      >
      <div class="p-4 text-sm leading-6 overflow-y-scroll max-h-96">
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2">
          <li>
            Nahrávaní dema spusť příkazem v console <code
              >record „název_dema“</code
            >.
          </li>
          <li>Nahrávání ukončíš příkazem <code>stop</code>.</li>
          <li>
            Nahrané demo spustíš příkazem <code>playdemo „název_dema“</code>.
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p>
          <strong>Hint:</strong> Příkazy <code>sv_cheats 1</code> a <code
            >r_drawothermodels 2</code
          > nepoužívej na herním serveru...
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
      <summary
        class="cursor-pointer py-3 px-4 font-semibold hover:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg text-xl"
        >Běžím s knifem rychleji?</summary
      >
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-auto mx-auto table-auto border-collapse border border-gray-600 rounded-lg contain-paint">
          <thead class="bg-gray-800">
            <tr>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-gray-200 border border-gray-700 uppercase">Rychlost</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 text-left font-semibold text-gray-200 border border-gray-700 uppercase">Zbraň</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-200 text-left">
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-600">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">260</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">Scout</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-600">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">250</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">Knife, Pistols, C4, HE, Flash, MAC-10, MP5, TMP, UMP</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-600">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">245</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">P90, Smoke</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-600">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">240</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">XM1014</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-600">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">235</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">SG552</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-600">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">230</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">M4A1</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-600">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">221</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">AK-47, AUG</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-600">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">220</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">FAMAS, M249, M3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-600">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">215</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">Galil</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-600">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">210</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-700">AWM, G3SG1, SG 550</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </details>

